## Covered by Package Guidelines (MCP)

The following topics are maintained as package guidelines and served via MCP `get_guideline()`. They are not duplicated here:

**Core:** App Config, CI/CD, Env Setup, I18n, PWA, Testing, Themes, Essences
**UI:** Components, Gotchas, Layouts, Pages, Routing, SEO
**Components:** Atomic Components, API Reference
**Templates:** Blog
**Functions:** Functions, Vercel
**CRUD:** CRUD Setup, CRUD Components
**CLI:** Version Control

---

**Convention over configuration. AI-first design.**
